NOTE ON MODEL WEIGHTS

This licence covers the source code only. Trained model weights distributed
via Releases are derived from datasets with more restrictive terms:

  FairFace   CC-BY 4.0        commercial use permitted
  UTKFace    research only    non-commercial
  MOT17      CC-BY-NC         non-commercial

Weights trained on those datasets inherit the most restrictive term and are
therefore not available for commercial use. See docs/DATASETS.md.
